Privacy Assessment","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Organizations frequently share data with third-party vendors."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn this workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Vendor Selected","Privacy Questionnaire","Data Processing Assessment","Security Assessment","Contract Review","Risk Classification","Approval","Ongoing Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"Important questions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What data does the vendor receive?"},{"text":"Why does it need the data?"},{"text":"Where is the data stored?"},{"text":"Does it use subcontractors?"},{"text":"What security controls exist?"},{"text":"How long is data retained?"},{"text":"What happens when the contract ends?"}]}]},{"heading":"Data Breach Response","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A privacy professional should understand the legal/compliance side of an incident."},{"type":"flow","items":["Potential Breach","Incident Detection","Containment","Fact Gathering","Identify Data Affected","Risk Assessment","Legal / Regulatory Assessment","Required Notifications","Remediation","Post-Incident Review"]},{"type":"p","text":"The Compliance Associate generally coordinates with legal, cybersecurity, IT, security, communications, and management teams rather than independently handling the technical incident."}]},{"heading":"Cybersecurity Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to become a cybersecurity engineer, but you should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Encryption"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorization"},{"text":"Access controls"},{"text":"Multi-factor authentication"},{"text":"Backups"},{"text":"Logging"},{"text":"Vulnerability management"},{"text":"Incident response"},{"text":"Network security basics"},{"text":"Cloud security fundamentals"},{"text":"This allows you to communicate effectively with security teams."}]}]},{"heading":"India-Focused Privacy Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constitutional privacy principles"},{"text":"India's data-protection framework"},{"text":"Information-technology legislation and rules relevant to data"},{"text":"Cybersecurity obligations"},{"text":"Sector-specific privacy requirements"},{"text":"Consumer protection"},{"text":"Contractual confidentiality"},{"text":"Regulatory requirements applicable to specific industries"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Because privacy law changes quickly, students should always verify the current legislation, rules, notifications and regulatory guidance before giving compliance advice."}]},{"heading":"International Privacy Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For multinational companies, understand major privacy frameworks and concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"European GDPR"},{"text":"UK data-protection framework"},{"text":"US privacy laws"},{"text":"Cross-border data transfers"},{"text":"International data-processing agreements"},{"text":"Standard contractual mechanisms"},{"text":"Global privacy governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong candidate should understand that:"},{"type":"flow","items":["One Company","Multiple Countries","Different Privacy Laws","Different Compliance Requirements","Global Privacy Framework","Local Implementation"]}]},{"heading":"Technology Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Word"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Document management"},{"text":"Compliance trackers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Database fundamentals"},{"text":"Cloud-computing basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Privacy technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GRC platforms"},{"text":"Privacy-management platforms"},{"text":"Con